ConvomailPhpImapOn = Email Collector now uses the PHP-IMAP library.
ConvomailFilingLimit = <b>Capacity:</b> Dolibarr's Email Collector runs at most about 100 collector jobs per 5-minute cycle, and each mailbox uses two, so about 50 mailboxes can log replies automatically.
ConvomailCronRefreshTokens = Refresh Convomail sign-in tokens
ConvomailCronRefreshTokensHelp = Keeps the Google / Microsoft 365 tokens of mail accounts valid, so automatic filing (Email Collector) can sign in.
ConvomailFilingHelp = Checks this mailbox every 5 minutes for <b>replies to emails sent from Dolibarr</b> and logs them on the agenda, with their third party, contact and project.<br><br>Two checks: <b>Inbox</b>, for replies you receive, and <b>Sent</b>, for replies you sent from another mail app such as your phone.<br><br>Only replies are logged, not newsletters or new conversations: use <b>Log to…</b> in the mailbox for those. Nothing is logged twice.
ConvomailFilingWatching = Checks Inbox and Sent every 5 minutes
ConvomailFilingLastCheck = Last check: %s
ConvomailFilingProblem = Problem
ConvomailFilingLastFailed = The last check failed: %s
ConvomailFilingDetailIn = Inbox: %s
ConvomailFilingDetailOut = Sent: %s
ConvomailFilingNeverChecked = not checked yet
ConvomailFilingTurnOnHelp = Start logging replies to this mailbox on the agenda, every 5 minutes.
ConvomailFilingRunNowHelp = Check this mailbox for replies now, instead of waiting for the next check.
ConvomailFilingTurnOffHelp = Stop logging replies automatically. Emails already logged stay on the agenda, and you can still log emails yourself with Log to….
ConvomailFilingHowTitle = How does "Log replies automatically" work?
ConvomailFilingHow1 = <b>What gets logged:</b> replies to emails sent from Dolibarr (they carry a Dolibarr reference that ties them to the original email), and, failing that, emails from an address Dolibarr knows. Each reply becomes an agenda event on the right third party, contact and project, owned by the mailbox's owner.
ConvomailFilingHow2 = <b>When:</b> every 5 minutes, by Dolibarr's scheduled jobs. <b>Check now</b> runs a check straight away.
ConvomailFilingHow3 = <b>Inbox and Sent:</b> the Inbox check logs replies you receive; the Sent check logs replies you wrote in another mail app (phone, Outlook), so the whole conversation is on the agenda.
ConvomailFilingHow4 = <b>Not logged:</b> newsletters, notifications and new conversations that don't answer a Dolibarr email. Use <b>Log to…</b> in the mailbox for those. An email is never logged twice, whether you log it yourself or it is logged automatically.
ConvomailFilingHow5 = <b>Where to see them:</b> the agenda, the third party's and contact's events, and the project's Emails tab.
ConvomailFilingHow6 = <b>Behind the scenes:</b> Dolibarr's Email Collector module does the checks. Turning this on creates two collector jobs for the mailbox; they follow the account's settings, and Turn off pauses them.
